# Windows batch files must be checked out with CRLF: cmd.exe resolves
# `goto :label` / `call :label` by byte offset, so an LF-only .bat can fail
# with "找不到指定的批处理标签" and abort the script mid-way. The portable
# launcher once shipped that way, which stopped it before it ever started the
# server, and the page was unreachable.
*.bat text eol=crlf
